Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
This branch's Graphite predates the Shape::getInflationRadius()/DrawParams::styledBounds() helpers (added by skia 54e1401f35, Oct 2026) and still computes the stroke inflation inline in ClipStack::DrawShape::applyStyle(). The fix's new logic was ported there with the helper body inlined: fills that project to a subpixel shape outset by 0.5*localAAOutset, and all non-fill styles (including hairlines) use SkStrokeRec::GetInflationRadius() with strokeWidth = max(localAAOutset, style.getWidth()) and the same effective miter/cap rules. The Shape.h/Shape.cpp/DrawParams.h/CoverBoundsRenderStep.cpp hunks only touch comments and SkASSERTs on those absent helpers and were dropped.

